;; gap_passive_cap_over_boundary: a SINGLE passive segment of 65537 bytes --
;; exactly ONE byte over script_gen::MAX_REGISTERED_SEGMENT_BYTES (65536).
;;
;; emit_preamble sums ALL passive segments' lengths and, if the total
;; exceeds the cap, emits a warning and skips registering ANY of them:
;;     let total: usize = info.passive_segments.iter().map(|(_, b)| b.len()).sum();
;;     if total > MAX_REGISTERED_SEGMENT_BYTES { eprintln!(warning); }
;;     else { for (segidx, bytes) in &info.passive_segments { ...register... } }
;; This is an all-or-nothing cliff keyed on the SUM, not per-segment: going
;; from 65536 to 65537 bytes flips behavior from "fully tracked" to "not
;; registered at all" for this module's only passive segment.
;;
;; Consequence at runtime: r3_mem::shadow_init's `s.passive.get(&segidx)`
;; returns None (never populated by passive_chunk), so the shadow_init call
;; on `memory.init:before` silently returns without touching the shadow.
;; Real memory.init still executes for real (native instruction, unaffected
;; by our instrumentation), writing the true segment bytes into memory. The
;; module then loads the last 4 bytes of the now-populated region in
;; non-excluded code: our shadow still holds its pre-init default (0, from
;; init_shadow's active-data seeding, which doesn't cover this passive
;; segment) while real memory holds the true non-zero bytes -> check_load
;; sees a mismatch and emits a SPURIOUS L event that the oracle -- whose
;; shadow tracking is native/engine-level and has no such registration cap
;; -- does not emit. This is a concrete, previously-undocumented false-L gap
;; distinct from every existing gen_tests/bulk_* case, all of which use
;; segments far under 64KB.
;; No proposal flags needed (bulk-memory is on by default in this wat2wasm).
(module
  (memory (export "mem") 4)  ;; 4 pages = 256KB, comfortably bigger than the 65537-byte segment
  (data $seg "\03\0a\11\18\1f\26\2d\34\3b\42\49\50\57\5e\65\6c\73\7a\81\88\8f\96\9d\a4\ab\b2\b9\c0\c7\ce\d5\dc\e3\ea\f1\f8\ff\06\0d\14\1b\22\29\30\37\3e\45\4c\53\5a\61\68\6f\76\7d\84\8b\92\99\a0\a7\ae\b5\bc\c3\ca\d1\d8\df\e6\ed\f4\fb\02\09\10\17\1e\25\2c\33\3a\41\48\4f\56\5d\64\6b\72\79\80\87\8e\95\9c\a3\aa\b1\b8\bf\c6\cd\d4\db\e2\e9\f0\f7\fe\05\0c\13\1a\21\28\2f\36\3d\44\4b\52\59\60\67\6e\75\7c\83\8a\91\98\9f\a6\ad\b4\bb\c2\c9\d0\d7\de\e5\ec\f3\fa\01\08\0f\16\1d\24\2b\32\39\40\47\4e\55\5c\63\6a\71\78\7f\86\8d\94\9b\a2\a9\b0\b7\be\c5\cc\d3\da\e1\e8\ef\f6\fd\04\0b\12\19\20\27\2e\35\3c\43\4a\51\58\5f\66\6d\74\7b\82\89\90\97\9e\a5\ac\b3\ba\c1\c8\cf\d6\dd\e4\eb\f2\f9\01\07\0e\15\1c\23\2a\31\38\3f\46\4d\54\5b\62\69\70\77\7e\85\8c\93\9a\a1\a8\af\b6\bd\c4\cb\d2\d9\e0\e7\ee\f5\fc\03\0a\11\18\1f\26\2d\34\3b\42\49\50\57\5e\65\6c\73\7a\81\88\8f\96\9d\a4\ab\b2\b9\c0\c7\ce\d5\dc\e3\ea\f1\f8\ff\06\0d\14\1b\22\29\30\37\3e\45\4c\53\5a\61\68\6f\76\7d\84\8b\92\99\a0\a7\ae\b5\bc\c3\ca\d1\d8\df\e6\ed\f4\fb\02\09\10\17\1e\25\2c\33\3a\41\48\4f\56\5d\64\6b\72\79\80\87\8e\95\9c\a3\aa\b1\b8\bf\c6\cd\d4\db\e2\e9\f0\f7\fe\05\0c\13\1a\21\28\2f\36\3d\44\4b\52\59\60\67\6e\75\7c\83\8a\91\98\9f\a6\ad\b4\bb\c2\c9\d0\d7\de\e5\ec\f3\fa\01\08\0f\16\1d\24\2b\32\39\40\47\4e\55\5c\63\6a\71\78\7f\86\8d\94\9b\a2\a9\b0\b7\be\c5\cc\d3\da\e1\e8\ef\f6\fd\04\0b\12\19\20\27\2e\35\3c\43\4a\51\58\5f\66\6d\74\7b\82\89\90\97\9e\a5\ac\b3\ba\c1\c8\cf\d6\dd\e4\eb\f2\f9\01\07\0e\15\1c\23\2a\31\38\3f\46\4d\54\5b\62\69\70\77\7e\85\8c\93\9a\a1\a8\af\b6\bd\c4\cb\d2\d9\e0\e7\ee\f5\fc\03\0a\11\18\1f\26\2d\34\3b\42\49\50\57\5e\65\6c\73\7a\81\88\8f\96\9d\a4\ab\b2\b9\c0\c7\ce\d5\dc\e3\ea\f1\f8\ff\06\0d\14\1b\22\29\30\37\3e\45\4c\53\5a\61\68\6f\76\7d\84\8b\92\99\a0\a7\ae\b5\bc\c3\ca\d1\d8\df\e6\ed\f4\fb\02\09\10\17\1e\25\2c\33\3a\41\48\4f\56\5d\64\6b\72\79\80\87\8e\95\9c\a3\aa\b1\b8\bf\c6\cd\d4\db\e2\e9\f0\f7\fe\05\0c\13\1a\21\28\2f\36\3d\44\4b\52\59\60\67\6e\75\7c\83\8a\91\98\9f\a6\ad\b4\bb\c2\c9\d0\d7\de\e5\ec\f3\fa\01\08\0f\16